FINAL LOCKED SYSTEM SPEC

Your attendance system will use:

SCRFD            → face detection
ArcFace          → 512D embeddings
Cosine Similarity → matching
SQLite           → database
OpenCV           → webcam stream
FastAPI          → backend

Optimization layer:

Face Tracking (KCF)
Embedding Cache
Recognition Cooldown

Target system:

Users: ~100
Camera: USB webcam
OS: Linux (Garuda)
Future: Raspberry Pi deployment
