↓
Camera captures 5 frames
↓
Embeddings extracted
↓
Average embedding computed
↓
Stored in SQLite
Phase 6 — Embedding Cache System

Goal: faster recognition.

Tasks

 Load embeddings at system startup

 Store embeddings in memory

 Update cache when new user registers

Cache Example
embeddings_cache = {
    user_id : embedding_vector
}
Benefit
No database queries during recognition
Phase 7 — Face Tracking Optimization

Goal: reduce CPU usage.

Tasks

